  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec / FR-08">Every save MUST be version-stamped (SPE eTag + projection schema version) and asserted before applying the op log. A stale base MUST re-anchor via `AnnotationReanchorService` (AUTO apply / REVIEW+ORPHAN surface) INSTEAD of failing with an eTag 500.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec / NFR-08 / project">An un-re-anchorable operation MUST surface as an ORPHAN — NEVER silently dropped and NEVER silently placed. Reuse `AnnotationReanchorService` bands; MUST NOT reimplement or fork them.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-009 / project">Re-anchor/version SUMMARY state (not the document bytes) is cached via `IDistributedCache` — MUST NOT use `IMemoryCache`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-007 / NFR-05">The SPE eTag read/write stays behind `SpeFileStore` — no `Microsoft.Graph` type in `Services/Compose/`. The applier is `byte[]`-in/`byte[]`-out.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-013 / NFR-05">`Services/Compose/` injects NO AI internals; Tier-1 NetArchTest stays green.</constraint>
