    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §10 / project">State the Placement Justification (save/re-anchor orchestration stays in `Services/Compose/`; reuses `SaveAsync`/`SpeFileStore`/`AnnotationReanchorService` seams). Verify BFF publish size ≤60 MB compressed, report absolute + delta vs ~49.63 MB (incl. PDBs). No new HIGH CVE. Run `/conflict-check` before the PR.</constraint>
  </constraints>

